| 依赖 | 版本 |
|------|------|
| Spring Boot | 2.3.7.RELEASE |
| Spring Cloud | Hoxton.SR9 |
| Spring Cloud Alibaba | 2.2.3.RELEASE |
| JDK | 1.8 |
| MyBatis-Plus | 3.3.2 |
| Hibernate Validator | 6.0.19.Final |
